- `AGENTS.md` — the router (it is also `CLAUDE.md`); every rule links to the skill that owns it.
- `.agents/skills/backend-architecture/SKILL.md`, `.agents/skills/frontend-architecture/SKILL.md` — the rules behind every spec above.
- `.agents/skills/testing/SKILL.md`, `.agents/skills/code-quality/SKILL.md` — runner, coverage floor, lint and TS policy.
